    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nbracketed\n\n### Description\n\nIt would be a handy key mapping that would repeat the last square bracket, or other motions.\r\n\r\nThinking about this more, what I want is [vim-space](https://github.com/spiiph/vim-space) but with a little more automatic integration, I guess? (And is maintained.)",
