            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nI considered adding it for a while during beta-testing, but opted for (not created at that time) a submode functionality of 'mini.clue'. It has a [separate example for 'mini.bracketed' submodes](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/a683bfe8e03293e3bb079e24c94e51977756a3ec/doc/mini-clue.txt#L405-L426).\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
