        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "To clarify, I was thinking that this motion-repeat plugin would be more generic than square bracket motions, including things like `n`/`N`, the jumplist, and `f`/`t`. So it would span across mini.bracketed, mini.jump, and possibly mini.jump2d?\r\n\r\nThis is sounding more and more complicated and is probably own dedicated plugin rather than being a part of any existing one.",
